  <http://example.org/example> "http://marineregions.org/mrgid/4963(Fangorn Bank) is a http://marineregions.org/ns/placetypes#Bank( ); has http://marineregions.org/ns/ontology#isPartOf( ); has http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#centroid( ); has at least 1 http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource( ); has at least 1 http://marineregions.org/ns/ontology#hasGeometry( ); has at least 1 http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified( ); has http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type( ); has at least 1 http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel( )" ;
